* OHMNI BEH-CAP-ALPOLY subcircuit (polarised aluminium polymer / hybrid), behavioural_approximation
* ports: p(+) n(-) flag. flag bitmask: 1 = V > VR*DER, 2 = reverse > VREVMAX, 4 = |i| > IPK (rush current)
.subckt ohm_alpoly p n flag params: C0=100u ESR=20m ESL=5n RLK=1meg VR=16 DER=0.8 VREVMAX=0.1 IPK=10
Lesl p a {ESL}
Resr a c {ESR}
Vsns c b 0
Cb b n {C0}
Rlk b n {RLK}
Bflag flag 0 V = '(v(b,n) > {VR*DER} ? 1 : 0) + (v(b,n) < -{VREVMAX} ? 2 : 0) + (abs(i(Vsns)) > {IPK} ? 4 : 0)'
.ends
